### Create FHIR Patient
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fhir
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceType": "Patient",
  "id": "patient-001",
  "name": [
    {
      "use": "official",
      "family": "Doe",
      "given": [
        "John"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "gender": "male",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-15"
}

### Get All FHIR Resources
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fhir